{"applicability_conditions":"Fe-Mn-Al-C 钢的热变形过程（论文针对该钢种在不同温度和应变速率下建立本构关系）；其余具体条件论文未明确说明。","identity":{"block_id":"b0042","equation_id":"equation_004","equation_number":"4","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\frac {\\sigma}{\\sigma_ {\\mathrm{p}}} = \\left[ \\frac {\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_ {\\mathrm{p}}} \\exp \\left(1 - \\frac {\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_ {\\mathrm{p}}}\\right) \\right] ^ {C}\\tag{4}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.jmrt.2021.08.079"},"latex":"\\frac{\\sigma}{\\sigma_{\\mathrm{p}}} = \\left[ \\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{p}}} \\exp \\left(1 - \\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{p}}}\\right) \\right]^{C}","purpose":"描述归一化流动应力（σ/σ_p）与归一化应变（ε/ε_p）之间的关系，用于预测热变形过程中的流动应力。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"流动应力（flow stress）","symbol":"\\sigma","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"峰值应力（peak stress）","symbol":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{p}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"应变（strain）","symbol":"\\varepsilon","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"峰值应变（peak strain）","symbol":"\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{p}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"材料常数（material constant）","symbol":"C","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"指数中的数值常数","symbol":"1","unit":null,"value":"1"}],"unmapped":["对公式(4)两边取自然对数可得到公式(5)：ln(σ/σ_p) = C[ln(ε/ε_p) + 1 - ε/ε_p]。","表1列出了Fe-Mn-Al-C钢在不同温度T和应变速率下的lnZ值。"]}